WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:05.970
With the ability to conjure an enormous ice
palace in just seconds, cause an eternal winter,

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:10.520
and even create sentient life, Elsa was already
an incredibly powered character.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:15.410
But in Frozen 2 the icy queen's legendary
powers are taken to another level when she

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:20.220
hears a mysterious voice calling to her and
she and Anna go on an epic quest to discover

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.300
the origin of her magical abilities.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.589
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers, I'm Jan and in
this video I'll be explaining all of Elsa's

00:00:26.589 --> 00:00:29.080
new powers in Frozen 2, her transformation
at the end of the movie, and the secret truth

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.429
about where her abilities came from.

00:00:31.429 --> 00:00:36.110
And if you'd like a chance to win a cool Frozen
2 Funko Pop, be sure to subscribe, and keep

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:37.320
watching for more details.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:41.700
There will, of course, be spoilers for the
movie, so take care if you haven't seen it

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.700
yet.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:46.540
By the end of Frozen, Elsa had learned to
control her magical ice abilities and over

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:51.150
the next three years her powers mature with
her, however, the Ice Queen still harbours

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.610
questions about the origin of her powers.

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:58.260
As Frozen 2 begins, we find that Elsa still
doesn't feel quite at ease with herself and

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:03.070
she loses control occasionally, accidentally
freezing objects when she gets distracted

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.070
and is surprised.

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.080
In a similar way to what happened when she
was younger, although the amount of ice has

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.979
grown as Elsa's powers have become stronger.

00:01:10.979 --> 00:01:14.780
What's distracting Elsa is a mysterious voice
that only she can hear.

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:18.390
"You've been hearing a voice and you didn't
think to tell me?"

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:23.130
And when one night Elsa decides to answer
the call, we see her magic begin to create

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:26.200
some new and exciting icy visions.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:30.619
Frozen 2 director Jennifer Lee has explained
that during Elsa's song "Into The Unknown"

00:01:30.619 --> 00:01:35.829
the voice is "[showing Elsa] pieces of the
past and [also] what her magic could be."

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:40.170
The movie's animators have also said that
"while it's Elsa's magic, it seems to be taken

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:42.159
over by these icy visions.

00:01:42.159 --> 00:01:44.619
She's not necessarily controlling it."

00:01:44.619 --> 00:01:49.369
If you watch the scene carefully, you'll notice
Elsa's ice magic creates visions of what's

00:01:49.369 --> 00:01:53.639
to come later in the movie;
such as her parting the mist to the Enchanted

00:01:53.639 --> 00:01:56.210
Forest;
the trees inside the forest;

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:59.819
reindeer running around;
visions of her young mother and father;

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:03.889
encounters with the four spirits;
and then Elsa stepping inside Ahtohallan and

00:02:03.889 --> 00:02:05.969
becoming the Fifth Spirit.

00:02:05.969 --> 00:02:11.009
Elsa's magic together with the voice is giving
her a sense of foresight into her future.

00:02:11.009 --> 00:02:15.250
As Elsa continues her exploration of these
new powers, the voice from the north calls

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:19.129
to her, creating a sudden burst of crystals
over Arendelle.

00:02:19.129 --> 00:02:23.459
Elsa sees that inside the crystals are symbols
which represent the four elements.

00:02:23.459 --> 00:02:28.010
These same four symbols also show up on the
monoliths at the entrance to the Enchanted

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:29.010
Forest.

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:34.130
And it's inside the forest where Elsa's powers
help her access hidden details about the past.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:39.000
When the gang are swirled up in a tornado
by the wind spirit Gale, Elsa is able to direct

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.380
powerful blasts of ice that freeze the wind
still.

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:47.519
And Elsa's icy blasts are also able to freeze
water droplets from the air and re-form them

00:02:47.519 --> 00:02:50.860
into sculptures of events that happened years
ago in the forest.

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:56.720
As Olaf's theory goes, water retains memory,
so Elsa's ice magic is able to reveal that

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:01.110
Elsa and Anna's parents met each other when
they were children in the forest.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:05.239
Once Elsa understands this new power, when
she discovers the wreck of their parents'

00:03:05.239 --> 00:03:09.330
ship, she's able to extract water droplets
that have remained soaked in the wooden panels

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:13.281
of the ship and freeze them into a tragic
icy vision of what happened to their mother

00:03:13.281 --> 00:03:14.480
and father.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:18.709
Elsa's abilities even extend to conjuring
up the voices of their parents just before

00:03:18.709 --> 00:03:20.980
they died in the storm.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:25.610
Inside the forest, we also get to see Elsa's
link to two of the other elemental spirits.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:30.879
When Bruni, the salamander fire spirit, sets
the forest trees on fire, it's Elsa who not

00:03:30.879 --> 00:03:34.930
only puts out the flames, but who is also
able to face the fiery little spirit creature

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:36.920
and make a connection with him.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:41.150
Although he burns hot on her hand, she's able
to calm him down with little snowflakes that

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:43.140
he loves to feel on his tongue.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:47.569
He can hear the voice that calls to Elsa and
helps guide her north towards it.

00:03:47.569 --> 00:03:50.310
"Should I know what that means?"

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:55.010
Frozen 2's animators have also said that Bruni
is "misunderstood" and Elsa can relate to

00:03:55.010 --> 00:04:00.359
that, as they've both had problems with their
powers running wild and getting out of control.

00:04:00.359 --> 00:04:04.569
Elsa is also connected to the Earth Giants,
and when they come roaming near their camp

00:04:04.569 --> 00:04:08.520
in the forest, she is actually a little more
excited than scared.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:12.840
She later explains to Anna that the giant
sensed her and came looking for her, proving

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:16.120
Elsa's connection to another of the four elements.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:20.449
During her time in the forest, Elsa also learns
from Honeymaren that there is a fifth spirit,

00:04:20.449 --> 00:04:25.199
"said to be a bridge between [people] and
the magic of nature" and that only Ahtohallan

00:04:25.199 --> 00:04:29.150
can provide an answer to who or what that
fifth spirit is.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:33.460
To reach Ahtohallan, Elsa must face her most
difficult challenge: crossing the extremely

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:37.949
dangerous Dark Sea, the same water that took
the life of her parents when they tried to

00:04:37.949 --> 00:04:39.470
sail through it.

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:43.940
Elsa's confidence and ability to concentrate
and focus her powers has grown tremendously

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:48.750
by this point and she begins by freezing a
huge pathway through the waves with an enormous

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.160
blast of ice.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:54.930
The titanic waves are still too much though
and they smash the pathway into huge chunks

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:59.830
of ice, taking Elsa underwater where she's
confronted by the water spirit, which takes

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.360
the form of a powerful stallion.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:06.870
This is a mythical creature from Nordic folklore
and is a fierce warrior and guardian that

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:10.660
only allows past those it deems worthy of
its respect.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:16.259
In the myths, it often tries to drown challengers,
which is exactly what it tries to do to Elsa.

00:05:16.259 --> 00:05:20.370
However, she eventually proves herself an
equal match to the water spirit when she uses

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:23.220
a barrage of ice powers to protect herself.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:27.751
And as she does with the wind and fire spirits,
Elsa is able to tame the water spirit, this

00:05:27.751 --> 00:05:31.750
time by creating an icy lasso which she uses
to mount the horse.

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:36.569
After she rides the stallion to the frozen
river of Ahtohallan, they bow to each other

00:05:36.569 --> 00:05:42.520
showing that Elsa has earned the respect of
this fearsome spirit by proving herself worthy.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:47.000
Elsa's arrival at Ahtohallan symbolically
represents her arriving home to embrace her

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:51.490
true nature and all of her powers, as the
lyrics of her song "Show Yourself" prove:

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:52.490
"I'm arriving..

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.870
And it feels like I am home."

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:58.500
As Elsa arrives she lets her hair flow loose
out of the constraints of her braid, a moment

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:02.780
that recalls how she let her hair down during
"Let It Go" in the first movie.

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:06.660
And the feelings of shame and guilt about
her powers which she'd repressed as she grew

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:07.660
up..

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:08.660
"Conceal it."

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:09.660
"Don't feel it."

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:13.879
..are now tossed aside as she gleefully runs
through the glacier's tunnels and caverns,

00:06:13.879 --> 00:06:17.979
leaping across chasms and tossing huge ice
columns aside.

00:06:17.979 --> 00:06:22.690
When Elsa reaches a cavern with symbols of
the four spirits, she uses her magic to bring

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:28.050
these together around a four-sided star and
symbol of unity, and Elsa now is revealed

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:29.990
as the Fifth Spirit.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:35.400
After uniting herself in spirit with Ahtohallan,
Elsa is now able to read the secret memories

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:38.290
of the past contained within the frozen river.

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:43.330
She begins to see memories of events from
her past including snuggling with her mother,

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:47.690
Marshmallow, she shudders at herself singing
"Let It Go", and sees villains like the Duke

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:49.250
of Weselton and Hans.

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:54.449
And as she goes deeper into the glacier, she
uncovers the shameful treachery of her grandfather

00:06:54.449 --> 00:06:57.960
when he secretly betrayed and attacked the
Northuldra people.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:02.670
As powerful as the Fifth Spirit is, Elsa is
still vulnerable, and as the lullaby "All

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:07.220
Is Found" warned, Elsa's guilt at uncovering
this dark history of one of her ancestors

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:08.880
proves too much.

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:13.590
Elsa literally freezes as she discovers each
new piece of the Arendellian deceit until

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:17.690
she's overcome and loses control entirely.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:22.430
And this is where Elsa's connection back to
Anna proves vital to her eventual survival.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:26.790
Remember that Anna talked about "two sisters,
one mind" when playing charades with Elsa

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.660
and the gang at the beginning of the movie.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:33.889
Honeymaren also told Elsa that the fifth spirit
is a bridge between worlds and as Elsa later

00:07:33.889 --> 00:07:38.780
points out, a bridge has two sides and Anna
is the other side of that bridge.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:43.289
Elsa realises this and with her powers she
sends a ray of ice magic to the cave where

00:07:43.289 --> 00:07:45.370
Anna and Olaf are sheltering.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:49.930
The magic forms a sculpture that tells Anna
the truth about their grandfather.

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:54.319
It's only when Anna continues on despite the
loss of her sister and Olaf, and destroys

00:07:54.319 --> 00:07:58.900
the dam, that Arendelle's wrong against the
Northuldra can finally be righted, an act

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:01.841
which also liberates and saves Elsa from her
icy doom.

00:08:01.841 --> 00:08:03.370
"What would I do without you?"

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.110
"You'll always have me."

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:09.370
In fact, Gran Pabbie also foreshadowed that
Anna would be needed to save Elsa from her

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:11.320
fate:
"Magic is very alluring.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:14.460
Without you she may lose herself to it."

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:18.699
With Elsa free, we finally get to witness
the full extent of her powers as the Fifth

00:08:18.699 --> 00:08:19.699
Spirit.

00:08:19.699 --> 00:08:23.930
She's able to call on the water spirit and
ride it at incredible speed to Arendelle,

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:28.150
where she throws up an enormous ice wall which
has the shapes of the four elements and the

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.410
fifth spirit on it.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:33.800
The wall blocks the deluge of water that's
about to engulf the kingdom and then Elsa

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:38.370
raises her arms, and with the force of her
magic she blasts the ice wall and turns the

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.620
water to flow away from Arendelle.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:44.670
Unlike the moment when the crystals appeared
at the end of "Into The Unknown", this time

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:49.370
Elsa is in full control and this new power
level calls back to GranPabbie's words:

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:53.480
"We have always feared Elsa's powers were
too much for this world.

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:56.560
Now we must pray they are enough."

00:08:56.560 --> 00:09:01.700
As the fifth spirit, Elsa has power to summon
all four spirits and this is reflected in

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:06.650
the design of her final white dress which
has motifs of all of the four elemental symbols.

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:11.700
And it's also represented in the unity necklace
that Elsa wears around her neck.

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:16.200
Elsa also seems to have the power of resurrection
although her rebirth appears to be a gift

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:20.860
from the spirits that reward Anna's act of
heroism in restoring balance to the world

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:23.470
by destroying the Arendellian dam.

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:27.661
Given Elsa's almost goddess-like powers that
we see at the end of Frozen 2, it will be

00:09:27.661 --> 00:09:31.260
fascinating to see how a future story could
take these forward.

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:35.680
Any potential villains would need to be either
particularly powerful or able to strike at

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:40.230
some hidden weakness in Elsa, either a new
one or something we've seen such as her feelings

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:44.300
of guilt about the past which caused her to
freeze while in Ahtohallan.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:48.760
Fans of other mythic and epic fictional characters
may also compare Elsa's power levels with

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:53.160
Gandalf the White from Lord of the Rings,
the Avatar from The Last Airbender and Leeloo

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.010
from The Fifth Element.

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:59.350
Ahtohallan may be the source of Elsa's powers,
but a question that I've seen from a lot of

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:02.310
you is why was Elsa born with magical abilities?

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:05.360
The answer seems to be that they are a gift
from the spirits.

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:10.100
After fighting broke out between the Arendellians
and the Northuldra people, Elsa's mother Iduna

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:11.750
saved Agnarr's life.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:16.910
As Anna explains to Elsa, because Iduna "saved
her enemy, her good deed was rewarded with

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:18.260
[a magical daughter]."

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:23.030
And as Elsa learns, the star-shaped symbol
she sees in the sky is the same as the pattern

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:27.320
on the shawl that Queen Iduna gave Elsa and
Anna when they were children, establishing

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:30.470
both the sisters and mother's connection with
the four spirits.

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:34.250
So what do you think about Elsa's new powers
in Frozen 2?

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:38.970
And do you have any theories or ideas on how
she could use them in future Frozen stories?

